    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b823d8178bfd586b7a58642a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我不知道现在该对开始离去的她说些什么。\n但是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "db8fa06dd2bc895e270d2600a293aa88f4ff6d892d43e50f199cb05c3e834e05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        73,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/73/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c3455264b15e1be1e3840c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在问她『这就是你所期望的明星吗』的时候，\n出现的间隔。在和她相处的日子里，\n我在某些瞬间感受到过与那相似的东西。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b103310529eb846b82b1ab9475989e3c1375f129f1f71a4035a70120fd842647",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        74,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/74/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c206649bc1cbf249aebe4d4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那些瞬间，就是她在听到装傻，\n并在内心吐槽时候的瞬间。",
      "source_fingerprint": "142a438cf21d390216fc979a75038fe519d2805f7db4dc31f60aa6181dd35f93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        75,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/75/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a6a1a51dbc603d8d970f714",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（但是，她没有吐槽……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aef0ec1697d02887d2b7b071b6d696fdc21f61a01c3138833cee00bce6f0773",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
