    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d6142ad3c98794449e3f149",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『……没有自信了』",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b48703c528788dcc3b9193e784f1cae0fcce2c0522c99fcdb58e2281c299389",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        77,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/77/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e5f46df9e23b3d52359e0bd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……她现在因杏目强烈的不服输、\n以及这带来的压倒性结果丢失了自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f30924b0821107fd4039577ae6f8e1546e97e86309038321e47268007422427b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        78,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/78/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7d81af0863a7833ef17e9be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，若能取回这份自信的话，\n说不定她能够再次向着自己想成为的\n明星（花形）前进……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "364256490afe9d01c5c5cc76a8b311d12dafac52ea2615934751d8a04bedefa8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        79,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/79/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba0edcdae5287372fe6ed01e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "实况",
      "source_fingerprint": "50349a592c466fb97eeafeb81fd3fa65c8c3b2e779463937300c4c8f97230140",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
