      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/81/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6265e45aa39f3435f0e26eaa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我去找了黄金巨匠，\n问她能不能给旺紫丁一些鼓励的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21fa1112ea8036c7c7aee32df28d66754f12205c27dd68084f3f77964e10a662",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        82,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/82/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:985e25331f8d5d19bf3342c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "心想要是旺紫丁憧憬的她给出的话语，\n说不定能让她取回前进（吐槽）的自信――",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ba65d92646abb99037cc0f7fcfb351d60b294b52ebc8ad8f0050486c90986f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1130/storytimeline_501130114.json",
